<div style="min-height:100%;background:var(--color-bg);color:var(--color-text);font-family:var(--font-body);padding:0 20px 64px;">
  <div style="max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:20px 0 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:var(--color-neutral-100);">simaojunior<span style="color:var(--color-accent);">.dev</span></span>
        <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);">hidden leaf branch office · est. 2019</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;white-space:nowrap;">
        <a href="/" style="color:var(--color-neutral-100);">[home]</a>
        <a href="#writing">[scrolls]</a>
        <a href="#projects">[bingo book]</a>
        <a href="#about">[about]</a>
        <a href="#">[uses]</a>
        <a href="#">[guestbook]</a>
        <button
          type="button"
          data-theme-toggle
          class="theme-toggle-btn"
          style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;background:transparent;color:var(--color-neutral-400);border:1px solid var(--color-neutral-700);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:5px 9px;cursor:pointer;"
        >☾ dark</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:12px;background:var(--color-accent-900);border:1px solid var(--color-accent-800);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:9px 12px;border-right:1px solid var(--color-accent-800);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;color:var(--color-accent-300);flex:none;">
        <span style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-chakra);animation:blink 1.4s steps(1,end) infinite;"></span>MISSION BOARD
      </div>
      <div style="overflow:hidden;flex:1;">
        <div style="display:flex;white-space:nowrap;width:max-content;animation:marquee 34s linear infinite;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--color-neutral-400);">
          <span style="padding:9px 0;">✧ status: shipping day to day &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✧ training: Elixir, OTP supervision trees &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✧ site running on Phoenix + Fly.io &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✧ rewatching Shippuden, arc 14 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✧ last updated {last_updated_label()} &nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
          <span style="padding:9px 0;">✧ status: shipping day to day &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✧ training: Elixir, OTP supervision trees &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✧ site running on Phoenix + Fly.io &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✧ rewatching Shippuden, arc 14 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✧ last updated {last_updated_label()} &nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:40px;padding:52px 0 12px;align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px;">
          <span style="display:block;height:9px;width:52px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--color-neutral-400),var(--color-neutral-700));"></span>
          <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-chakra);">konoha shinobi · reg. 012-607</span>
        </div>
        <h1 style="font-family:'Yuji Mai',var(--font-heading);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,58px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:0;margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--color-neutral-100);">
          Simão Júnior
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-neutral-300);margin:0 0 14px;max-width:46ch;text-wrap:pretty;">
          Senior backend engineer with 5+ years building critical, scalable systems for high-availability environments: Node.js, TypeScript, Elixir, Postgres, event-driven architectures on AWS.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--color-neutral-400);margin:0 0 26px;max-width:52ch;text-wrap:pretty;">
          Self-taught, still training. This site is the slow internet: notes I actually finished, projects that are still running, and a shrine to a ninja cartoon I have not grown out of.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#writing">Read the scrolls</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#projects">Bingo book</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:simao.msjr@gmail.com">Send a summon</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="border:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);border-radius:var(--radius-md);background:var(--color-surface);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--color-neutral-900);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-neutral-400);">
          <span>ninja registration card</span>
          <span style="border:1px solid var(--color-chakra-dim);color:var(--color-chakra);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:2px;letter-spacing:0.1em;white-space:nowrap;">A-RANK</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;">
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            village
          </div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-200);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            São Paulo, BR · UTC-3
          </div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            rank
          </div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-200);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            Jōnin · backend
          </div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            affinity
          </div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-200);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            Onboarding &amp; KYC systems, event-driven architecture
          </div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            squad
          </div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-200);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            Caveo · backend (hybrid)
          </div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);">status</div>
          <div style="padding:9px 12px;color:var(--color-leaf-light);">
            active duty · open to interesting missions
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-neutral-600);margin-bottom:8px;">
            jutsu registry
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <span class="tag tag-accent">Elixir</span>
            <span class="tag tag-neutral">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tag tag-neutral">Node.js</span>
            <span class="tag tag-neutral">PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="tag tag-neutral">AWS</span>
            <span class="tag tag-outline">shadow clone (N8N)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="writing" style="padding:52px 0 0;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:500;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;color:var(--color-neutral-100);">
          Mission log
        </h2>
        <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);">all {@total_posts} scrolls</span>
      </div>

      <a
        :for={post <- @posts}
        href="#"
        class="mission-row"
        style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(220px,1fr) auto;gap:8px 18px;align-items:baseline;padding:16px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);color:inherit;"
      >
        <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">{post.date}</span>
        <span>
          <span style="display:block;font-size:17px;color:var(--color-neutral-100);margin-bottom:4px;">{post.title}</span>
          <span style="display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--color-neutral-400);line-height:1.6;max-width:65ch;">{post.description}</span>
        </span>
        <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--color-chakra);white-space:nowrap;">{Sjr.Blog.rank(
          post
        )} · {Sjr.Blog.reading_time_minutes(post)} min</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div id="projects" style="padding:52px 0 0;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:500;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;color:var(--color-neutral-100);">
          Bingo book
        </h2>
        <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);">4 active · 2 rogue (honest)</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:14px;">
        <div class="card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
          <div class="card-kicker">open source · Go</div>
          <div class="card-title">kagebun</div>
          <div class="card-body">
            Shadow-clone your production traffic onto a staging service and diff the responses. 1.2k stars, still surprised.
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:auto;padding-top:8px;">
            <span class="tag tag-outline">Go</span><span class="tag tag-outline">CLI</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
          <div class="card-kicker">side project</div>
          <div class="card-title">noted</div>
          <div class="card-body">
            A notes app that is one Postgres table and refuses to sync. Used daily by me and four other people.
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:auto;padding-top:8px;">
            <span class="tag tag-outline">TypeScript</span><span class="tag tag-outline">Postgres</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
          <div class="card-kicker">tiny</div>
          <div class="card-title">cli_kanban</div>
          <div class="card-body">
            Kanban in the terminal, because the browser tab was always in the way. 200 lines, zero dependencies.
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:auto;padding-top:8px;">
            <span class="tag tag-outline">Node</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
          <div class="card-kicker">rogue · archived</div>
          <div class="card-title">rasengan.css</div>
          <div class="card-body">
            A spinning loader in 40 bytes of CSS. Abandoned years ago, still copied into other people's projects.
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:auto;padding-top:8px;">
            <span class="tag tag-outline">CSS</span><span class="tag tag-outline">spite</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin:52px 0 0;padding:26px 24px;border-radius:var(--radius-md);background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--color-section),var(--color-section-glow));border:1px solid var(--color-section-ghost);">
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-chakra);margin-bottom:10px;">
        forbidden scroll · my ninja way
      </div>
      <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(20px,3.4vw,28px);line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#eef0e6;margin:0;max-width:44ch;text-wrap:pretty;">
        Ship the version you can explain at 3am. Then teach it to someone else, or you never really learned it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      id="about"
      style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:40px;padding:52px 0 0;align-items:start;"
    >
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:500;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--color-neutral-100);">
          Three rules
        </h2>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
          <div style="border-left:2px solid var(--color-accent-700);padding-left:14px;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;color:var(--color-neutral-100);margin-bottom:3px;">
              Boring on purpose
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-neutral-500);">
              The clever solution is the one you get paged about.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="border-left:2px solid var(--color-accent-700);padding-left:14px;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;color:var(--color-neutral-100);margin-bottom:3px;">
              Teach it or you don't know it
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-neutral-500);">
              Every post here started as an explanation I owed someone on my team.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="border-left:2px solid var(--color-accent-700);padding-left:14px;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;color:var(--color-neutral-100);margin-bottom:3px;">
              Never go back on your word
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-neutral-500);">
              Borrowed from a certain orange idiot. It still holds up for estimates.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:500;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--color-neutral-100);">
          Academy record
        </h2>
        <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;">
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">2026</span><span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">Senior Backend Engineer ·
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-500);">Caveo</span></span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">2025-26</span><span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">Backend Engineer (Mid III) ·
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-500);">Caveo</span></span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">2023-25</span><span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">Backend Engineer ·
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-500);">Nextcode</span></span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">2021-23</span><span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">Backend Engineer (Junior) ·
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-500);">Nextcode</span></span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:10px 0;">
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">2018-21</span><span style="color:var(--color-neutral-500);">B.Sc. Information Systems, Universidade Anhembi Morumbi</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:22px;padding:14px;border:1px dashed var(--color-neutral-700);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);">
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-neutral-600);margin-bottom:8px;">
            currently training
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--color-neutral-400);">
            Reading
            <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">Designing Data-Intensive Applications</span>
            (third attempt) · learning Elixir · rewatching Shippuden for the arc where nothing happens
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:56px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;">
      <div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px;">
          <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:88px;height:31px;border:1px solid var(--color-neutral-700);background:var(--color-neutral-900);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--color-chakra);text-align:center;">HAND CODED<br />NO BUILD STEP</span>
          <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:88px;height:31px;border:1px solid var(--color-neutral-700);background:var(--color-neutral-900);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--color-neutral-400);text-align:center;">RSS<br />YES REALLY</span>
          <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:88px;height:31px;border:1px solid var(--color-neutral-700);background:var(--color-neutral-900);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--color-neutral-400);text-align:center;">TEAM 7<br />FOREVER</span>
          <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:88px;height:31px;border:1px solid var(--color-neutral-700);background:var(--color-neutral-900);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--color-neutral-400);text-align:center;">BEST VIEWED<br />IN ANY BROWSER</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="https://github.com/simaojunior">github</a><a href="#">bluesky</a><a href="#">linkedin</a><a href="#">rss</a><a href="mailto:simao.msjr@gmail.com">email</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:right;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--color-neutral-600);line-height:1.9;">
        <div>
          you are shinobi no.
          <span style="display:inline-block;padding:2px 6px;background:var(--color-neutral-900);border:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);color:var(--color-chakra);letter-spacing:0.22em;">0042871</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          member of the <a href="#">webring</a> · <a href="#">← prev</a> · <a href="#">next →</a>
        </div>
        <div>© {current_year()} Simão Júnior · no cookies, no trackers, no popups</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
